#: kcm.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Unable to save settings because a temporary directory could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Kunne ikke gemme indstillinger da en midlertidig mappe ikke kunne oprettes."

#: kcm.cpp:139
msgid "Unable to save settings because the config could not be opened."
msgstr "Kunne ikke gemme indstillinger da konfigurationen ikke kunne åbnes."

#: kcm.cpp:214
msgid ""
"Unable to synchronise Plasma settings because the 'plasmalogin' user does "
"not exist. Please check your Plasma Login install."
msgstr ""
"Kunne ikke synkronisere Plasma-indstillinger fordi `plasmalogin`-brugeren "
"ikke findes. Tjek venligst din Plasma Login-installation."

#: kcm.cpp:269
msgid ""
"Unable to reset Plasma settings because the 'plasmalogin' user does not "
"exist. Please check your Plasma Login install."
msgstr ""
"Kunne ikke nulstille Plasma-indstillinger fordi `plasmalogin`-brugeren ikke "
"findes. Tjek venligst din Plasma Login-installation."

